// Adafruit NeoPixel Stick, product 1426. Seated frame: z = 0 is the header
// plastic's underside, so the board's underside is at z = 2.54 and its top at z = 4.14.
// The Eagle board is 50.80 x 10.16 mm. LED centres are 6.35 mm apart at Eagle y = 3.810,
// which is y = -1.27 once the board is centred. CN2 is the input connector, a 1x4 at
// Eagle (1.397, 5.08). From the LED edge outward its pads are GND, 5V, DIN and GND.
// This header keeps the first three, across the board width, and leaves the outer GND off.
