      "what": "the drawing's connectors",
      "why": "Product 1426's Eagle board uses two 1x4 surface-mount connectors. This module fits a 1x3 through-hole header at the input end, across the board width, GND then 5V then DIN, so it plugs into a breadboard. The fourth pin, a second GND, and the last pixel's DOUT are not brought out."
