    {
      "what": "the LED package",
      "why": "The Eagle board places 5050 LEDs on a 6.35 mm pitch. The pixels here are the catalog's SK68XXMINI-HS, 3.7 x 3.5 mm, on that same pitch and at the drawing's centres. The outline is the Eagle board, 50.80 x 10.16 mm, with its two 2.0 mm holes. The product page lists 51.10 x 10.22 x 3.19 mm overall, the board and the 5050s with no through-hole header. This model seats the board on a header, so the pins hang below the seating plane and the assembly is taller."
